    {
      "id": "claim_66de1e26fcf84ecb88cf3078233f8140",
      "statement": "The `S3ImageStreamer` loads the Parquet manifest into memory and lazily yields RGB PIL Image objects directly from remote S3 URLs without local image disk persistence, supporting persistent single-connection sequential streaming and multithreaded concurrent streaming via a `ThreadPoolExecutor`.",
