    {
      "id": "claim_c7d82d7ed73b4f79b549cdef8c91e407",
      "statement": "The `_prepare_balanced_manifest` function samples observation records evenly across unique taxa based on a per-taxon quota, optionally shuffling partitions with a deterministic random seed before concatenation, to eliminate taxon representation imbalance during streaming.",
